5,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Since our current habit isn't working, we need a structured approach. Let's look at the data before we decide on a new system for the year.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. A rational analysis of the current workload and usage will prevent us from implementing a flawed system.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I just want the rooms to be clean all the time! I'm tired of guessing if the bathroom is scary today!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It would be lovely to find a way that keeps us all happy. I wonder how we've been handling the costs of supplies lately.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,Harmony is the most precious thing in a home. Let us ensure our choice preserves our friendship more than it polishes the floors.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I'll check the ""Stopwatch timing of a full pass"" and ""What each housemate counts as done"" to see the actual labor involved.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I'll look into ""Absences on the wall calendar"" and ""A fortnight's watch on kitchen use"" to see who is actually using the space.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I want to know why it gets dirty! I'll check ""Bathroom grout after the July scrub"" and ""What each housemate counts as done""!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I will look at the ""Bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts"" and the ""Management office rate sheet and billing.""","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I'll examine the ""Rows recorded in the house chat"" and the ""Note left by the previous tenants"" to see where we might stumble.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, it's a good idea to check the standards. If we don't agree on what ""done"" means, no schedule will work.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, timing the tasks is a practical start. It will help us determine if the burden is too high for a rota.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Benjamin, do you think the calendar will show who is the messiest? I bet it will!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I hope the billing information helps us find a fair way to share the costs of our cleaning supplies.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I am interested to see if the previous tenants left us any wisdom, or perhaps a warning about our choices.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
