35,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The timing is significant; a full pass takes over an hour and a half. Also, our definitions of ""done"" vary wildly, which explains the inconsistency.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"My findings show a disparity. Some of us are rarely here, yet the kitchen mess is generated by only a few people.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The bathroom grout gets black again in just eleven days! And @Minako is right, some people just wipe the basin and call it a day!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"We are spending about 2,300 yen a month on sprays, often buying duplicates. Also, a professional cleaner would cost 4,200 yen an hour.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The house chat shows our fights start with reminders of undone chores. More worryingly, previous tenants who split rooms permanently stopped speaking.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, if usage is uneven, a simple rotation might feel unfair to those who don't contribute to the mess.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Exactly. A fixed rota ignores the fact that some people are away for weeks, while others are here constantly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"If the bathroom gets dirty so fast, maybe we need to clean it more often? But I don't want to do it alone!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Servas, it is sad that the previous tenants lost their friendship. We must avoid any arrangement that creates resentment.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, Shizue. The ""permanent"" approach seems dangerous. We need a system that doesn't turn us into strangers in our own home.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shizue, the cost of a professional is high, but it would remove the labor entirely. We must weigh the cost against our time.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, the labor is high, but the usage is concentrated. Perhaps the people who use the kitchen most should do more?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"I just want it to be clean! If a professional does it, will it stay clean longer than eleven days?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I am worried about the supply costs too. We need a way to track who pays for the bleach and bags.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, while logic suggests usage-based work, forcing people to track every coffee made might create more rows in the chat.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
