60,3,1,talk,Minako,,"We have three options: A is a weekly rota, B is a paid service, and C is permanent assignments. Given the labor time, A and C seem taxing.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Option C is out; it's what the previous tenants did and it failed. Option A is unfair given the varying absences and usage.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"I don't like Option C because I don't want to be ""the bathroom person"" forever! Option B sounds like a dream!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option B would be expensive, but it would solve the arguments over who did what. We just need a fair way to split the bill.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option A could lead to the ""reminders"" that cause rows. Option B removes the source of conflict entirely, which protects our harmony.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shizue, if we choose B, we can use the management office's billing system to ensure the costs are settled monthly.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, I agree. While B is a financial cost, it is a rational trade-off to avoid the social cost of resentment and unfair labor.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! If we pick B, I won't have to brace myself before entering the bathroom anymore! I vote for B!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I feel more comfortable with B. It ensures the supplies and labor are handled professionally and the costs are transparent. I vote B.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"To keep us on speaking terms for the next year, removing the chore-burden is the wisest path. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minako,,"I agree. The time saved is worth the expense, and it eliminates the disputes over cleaning standards. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,The data on absences and usage makes a rota impractical. A professional service is the only equitable solution. I vote B.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Sakura,,Everyone likes B! This is the best day ever!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shizue,,It is a relief that we have found a solution that prioritizes both cleanliness and our friendship.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,A wise consensus. Let us embrace the peace that comes with a clean home and a clear conscience.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
